  "common_gotchas": [
    "Project SOP creates profiles; it does not by itself trim or bridge the resulting surface.",
    "Parametric projection can distort or remap geometry compared with spatial vector projection.",
    "Turn off explicit userange when reprojecting parametric extracts from Profile SOP unless that remap is intentional.",
    "Invisible profiles may still exist and affect downstream profile-aware SOPs."
  ],
  "related_snippets": [
