  "build_relevance": "surface-profile-projection",
  "last_verified": "2026-06-18",
  "key_concepts": [
    "Project SOP creates trim/profile curves by projecting a face onto a spline surface.",
    "Projection can be vector-based along an axis/vector or parametric using source U/V ranges.",
    "Project SOP is usually followed by Trim, Bridge, or Profile SOP to use or refine the created profiles.",
    "Primitive SOP can later transform profiles, but profile rotations are effectively limited to Z."
  ]
